4. Added a wrapper div with a test id for easier testing/debugging
5. Kept the state management and mock data structure
6. Added proper type definitions for the mock components using React.FC
7. Added more comprehensive mock data including loading and error states

This should resolve the TRPCProvider import error while still providing the necessary context for the ImportedComponent to render properly. The mock providers will pass through their children while maintaining the component structure.

